      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am not sure VRChat will grant this.\n\nIt is my understanding that the currently whitelisted StringDownloader domains were selected because they are services that don't allow scripting. They are usually all plain text and therefore considered *safe*.\n\nIf VRChat wants to support linking with Discord, they would likely be better off making their own bot or service that integrate with VRChat Groups.\n\nHowever, it does seem like VRChat is more interested in doing this sort of functionality through their Creator Economy. Which would arguably be better supported and more secure in the end.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
