  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-03-11T09:58:50.431Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I suggest for vrclinking.com to be added to URL whitelist to allow creators that use it to have no-worry access to it's world-API without having to rely on github fallback URL and have easy access to real-time linking API. Github pages are not made to have multiple hundreds of thousands requests a day with 100+ updates a day.\n\nVRCLinking is trusted by over 150 different big and small creators with well over 10K users who have linked with it.\n\nIt sees multiple hundreds of thousands requests a day and powers stuff in many big and small VRC Worlds daily.\n\nFor this reason I believe vrclinking.com being added to whitelist is a benefit for both users and creators alike.",
